    "template": "The moon hung low over the [sacred_location], casting a silvery glow on the stone table. Master Koji dipped his brush into a pot of [mystical_adjective] ink. He began to trace symbols that shimmered with an inner light.\n\nAs each line appeared, the paper emitted a soft [gentle_sound]. The ink seemed to flow like a tiny [landscape_feature] across the parchment. Every stroke was a lesson in patience and grace. The air smelled of sandalwood and fresh rain.\n\nSuddenly, the words lifted off the page and began to [graceful_action]. They spun in a circle, forming a halo of wisdom. The scribe watched as the letters transformed into a [serene_creature].\n\nThis magical being bowed before disappearing into the [luminous_color] mist. Only the faint scent of lotus remained in the room. The haiku was gone, but its peace stayed in the heart.",
